1
00:00:08,348 --> 00:00:11,156
(With Vengeance, Sincerely,
Your Broken Saintess Season 2)

2
00:01:31,603 --> 00:01:33,306
(Episode 7: Return to the Restoatt Estate)
Could that man

3
00:01:33,307 --> 00:01:35,704
(Episode 7: Return to the Restoatt Estate)
be the one who murdered my family?

4
00:01:36,755 --> 00:01:39,002
If so, what was his motive?

5
00:01:39,003 --> 00:01:40,557
Did he make me an orphan

6
00:01:40,558 --> 00:01:43,404
and bring me to the temple
just to take advantage of me?

7
00:01:43,405 --> 00:01:45,300
There has to be more to it.

8
00:01:45,803 --> 00:01:48,004
The "true plan" Louis overheard...

9
00:01:48,005 --> 00:01:50,948
Back before I teamed up with Sven,
I had snuck into the tower

10
00:01:50,949 --> 00:01:53,202
and heard him say something similar.

11
00:01:53,203 --> 00:01:54,749
The black rose

12
00:01:54,750 --> 00:01:56,925
and the experiment they mentioned
also bother me.

13
00:01:58,301 --> 00:02:00,201
There might be an even darker secret

14
00:02:00,202 --> 00:02:03,557
behind my family's deaths.

15
00:02:05,402 --> 00:02:06,754
Louis,

16
00:02:06,755 --> 00:02:11,258
you said Mother mentioned
"Daytime Acclaim" before she died?

17
00:02:11,750 --> 00:02:12,954
Y-Yes.

18
00:02:13,359 --> 00:02:16,902
Though I believe
she was just delirious at the time.

19
00:02:17,401 --> 00:02:19,404
I don't think so.

20
00:02:19,860 --> 00:02:24,453
She must have brought it up
because she needed to tell us something.

21
00:02:25,302 --> 00:02:27,545
Tell us something?

22
00:02:28,351 --> 00:02:29,455
Take a look at this.

23
00:02:29,456 --> 00:02:30,554
Is that...

24
00:02:34,100 --> 00:02:36,205
Pardon me for interrupting.

25
00:02:36,206 --> 00:02:38,050
May I have a moment?

26
00:02:38,051 --> 00:02:39,269
Yes, come in.

27
00:02:40,202 --> 00:02:42,150
I needed to see Miss Lua.

28
00:02:42,151 --> 00:02:45,599
My goodness, why the long face?

29
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:47,702
You look almost like Prince Sarid.

30
00:02:49,004 --> 00:02:50,802
Forgive me.

31
00:02:51,199 --> 00:02:53,296
What did you need me for?

32
00:02:53,297 --> 00:02:55,706
There's something I want you to see.

33
00:02:55,707 --> 00:02:59,409
I found this tucked in my old diary.

34
00:03:00,104 --> 00:03:01,298
Is this

35
00:03:01,299 --> 00:03:03,900
from when you were kids, Lady Diana?

36
00:03:03,901 --> 00:03:05,701
Prince Sven is in the photo too,

37
00:03:05,702 --> 00:03:07,499
so I thought I'd give it to you.

38
00:03:08,451 --> 00:03:12,556
Sven was quite handsome even as a boy.

39
00:03:13,502 --> 00:03:14,400
And for some reason,

40
00:03:14,401 --> 00:03:17,057
he looks a lot like a boy I used to know.

41
00:03:17,058 --> 00:03:20,953
I wish I could've told Mother
more about that boy.

42
00:03:20,954 --> 00:03:22,954
That's all I wanted to share.

43
00:03:22,955 --> 00:03:23,600
Louis.

44
00:03:23,601 --> 00:03:24,204
Yes.

45
00:03:24,205 --> 00:03:26,950
Don't keep Miss Lua too long,

46
00:03:26,951 --> 00:03:29,608
or Prince Sven might get upset.

47
00:03:30,654 --> 00:03:33,053
Please don't scare me, Lady Diana.

48
00:03:34,298 --> 00:03:35,704
Well then, I'll leave you two to talk.

49
00:03:40,854 --> 00:03:43,651
What I wanted to show you earlier

50
00:03:44,052 --> 00:03:48,478
is the deed to the Restoatt estate
that I reclaimed.

51
00:03:49,251 --> 00:03:52,052
With this, I can enter the estate freely.

52
00:03:52,053 --> 00:03:56,753
There might still be clues
pointing to what Mother was trying to say.

53
00:03:57,155 --> 00:03:58,853
I plan to go check it out right now.

54
00:03:59,806 --> 00:04:00,850
Check it out there?

55
00:04:00,851 --> 00:04:02,701
Are you planning to go alone?

56
00:04:02,702 --> 00:04:03,596
Yes.

57
00:04:03,597 --> 00:04:06,598
No one else can know about this.

58
00:04:06,957 --> 00:04:07,798
Louis,

59
00:04:07,799 --> 00:04:09,999
you haven't told anyone
about what we just discussed, have you?

60
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,505
O-Of course not.

61
00:04:13,001 --> 00:04:14,105
Good.

62
00:04:14,499 --> 00:04:16,001
If word got out,

63
00:04:16,002 --> 00:04:18,379
it could put Louis in danger too.

64
00:04:19,052 --> 00:04:21,007
You're going without even an escort?

65
00:04:21,506 --> 00:04:25,855
We could ask Duke Peridot
to request knights to escort you.

66
00:04:25,856 --> 00:04:26,613
The knights...

67
00:04:27,502 --> 00:04:31,103
Though I'm not sure
if Arianne is involved in this,

68
00:04:31,104 --> 00:04:32,600
if we involve the knights,

69
00:04:32,601 --> 00:04:35,553
word might reach her through Mr. Garret.

70
00:04:35,554 --> 00:04:37,206
That's far too risky.

71
00:04:37,901 --> 00:04:41,349
Having Shiji as an escort would be ideal,

72
00:04:41,350 --> 00:04:42,646
but Sven sent him away

73
00:04:42,647 --> 00:04:44,960
on a mission for a while.

74
00:04:46,004 --> 00:04:49,168
It's safer if I just go alone.

75
00:04:50,150 --> 00:04:53,462
Even if something happens,
I can use my torturing ability.

76
00:04:54,501 --> 00:04:55,807
I understand.

77
00:04:55,808 --> 00:04:57,847
Since you have concerns,

78
00:04:57,848 --> 00:04:59,655
I won't call for guards.

79
00:05:00,606 --> 00:05:02,477
But please let me go with you.

80
00:05:03,253 --> 00:05:04,950
Louis, you want to come with me?

81
00:05:04,951 --> 00:05:08,701
Only someone who knows the truth
like me can accompany you now.

82
00:05:08,702 --> 00:05:11,901
I'll do whatever it takes
to keep you safe.

83
00:05:11,902 --> 00:05:13,553
Wait!

84
00:05:13,554 --> 00:05:16,689
I'll go ask Lady Diana
for permission to leave.

85
00:05:20,103 --> 00:05:21,499
Mother,

86
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:24,446
what were you trying to tell me?

87
00:05:25,304 --> 00:05:27,199
The truth about my family's deaths...

88
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:29,212
I will uncover it myself.

89
00:05:30,948 --> 00:05:34,188
I never thought I'd get the chance
to ride with you, Miss Lua.

90
00:05:34,900 --> 00:05:38,099
But I'm not the one holding the reins.

91
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:39,855
Borrowing clothes from Lady Diana

92
00:05:39,856 --> 00:05:41,650
- They suit you well.
- feels improper.

93
00:05:41,651 --> 00:05:43,453
She didn't ask any questions,

94
00:05:43,454 --> 00:05:46,104
and even generously lent us
one of Duke Peridot's prized horses.

95
00:05:46,105 --> 00:05:48,002
The Duchess and Lady Diana
are deeply grateful to you.

96
00:05:48,003 --> 00:05:52,204
After all, you saved the Duchess's life.

97
00:05:52,753 --> 00:05:56,140
They both want to repay your kindness
however they can.

98
00:05:56,756 --> 00:05:58,902
They really don't need to go that far.

99
00:05:58,903 --> 00:06:01,200
Still, I'll gratefully
accept their help now.

100
00:06:01,606 --> 00:06:02,853
I'll need you to take me there.

101
00:06:02,854 --> 00:06:04,304
Then let's head off.

102
00:06:06,148 --> 00:06:08,058
To the Restoatt estate.

103
00:06:10,748 --> 00:06:11,800
Miss Lua,

104
00:06:11,801 --> 00:06:14,404
may I ask you something while we're here?

105
00:06:14,405 --> 00:06:15,501
What is it?

106
00:06:15,502 --> 00:06:18,565
What is your relationship
with Prince Sven?

107
00:06:18,566 --> 00:06:19,505
What?

108
00:06:19,506 --> 00:06:23,751
I mean no disrespect.
I know you're helping orphans together.

109
00:06:23,752 --> 00:06:25,650
It's just that when I saw you two,

110
00:06:25,651 --> 00:06:30,008
you seemed to share a deeper bond
than just partners.

111
00:06:31,055 --> 00:06:32,107
A bond...

112
00:06:32,504 --> 00:06:35,702
I suppose accomplices
share that sort of bond.

113
00:06:35,703 --> 00:06:37,658
Though my feelings for Sven...

114
00:06:38,755 --> 00:06:40,900
Even if there's something between you,

115
00:06:40,901 --> 00:06:42,751
I won't pry.

116
00:06:42,752 --> 00:06:45,204
It's just my duty
on behalf of the Restoatt family

117
00:06:45,205 --> 00:06:48,752
to make sure
your future husband is worthy.

118
00:06:49,399 --> 00:06:50,498
Husband?

119
00:06:50,499 --> 00:06:52,206
He's royalty.

120
00:06:52,207 --> 00:06:53,599
That's impossible.

121
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:55,602
Still, I value my life,

122
00:06:55,603 --> 00:06:58,554
so please don't tell him
we rode a horse together.

123
00:06:58,555 --> 00:06:59,595
Oh my...

124
00:06:59,596 --> 00:07:03,476
You stop listening once you get flustered.
You haven't changed a bit.

125
00:07:04,300 --> 00:07:05,100
Miss Lua,

126
00:07:05,101 --> 00:07:07,259
once we clear this forest,
the estate is just ahead.

127
00:07:07,260 --> 00:07:08,061
Right.

128
00:07:11,948 --> 00:07:13,251
What's that?

129
00:07:20,350 --> 00:07:22,600
Commander, do you have a moment?

130
00:07:22,601 --> 00:07:23,701
Come in.

131
00:07:24,157 --> 00:07:26,556
There's an urgent matter to report.

132
00:07:26,955 --> 00:07:31,032
Lingering monsters
have been spotted in several areas.

133
00:07:31,553 --> 00:07:33,797
What? Any casualties?

134
00:07:33,798 --> 00:07:35,001
Nothing serious yet,

135
00:07:35,002 --> 00:07:37,397
but there have been multiple sightings.

136
00:07:37,398 --> 00:07:40,155
We should take action as soon as possible.

137
00:07:40,156 --> 00:07:41,250
Understood.

138
00:07:41,251 --> 00:07:43,802
I'll deploy knights immediately.

139
00:07:44,300 --> 00:07:46,551
I thought Dedmond's arrest

140
00:07:46,552 --> 00:07:48,999
solved the monster crisis.

141
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,802
Were some of them hiding?

142
00:07:51,705 --> 00:07:52,602
Is something wrong?

143
00:07:52,603 --> 00:07:53,602
No.

144
00:07:53,603 --> 00:07:56,147
It's just that when you're focused,

145
00:07:56,148 --> 00:07:58,806
you resemble your father a lot.

146
00:07:59,750 --> 00:08:01,207
Perhaps.

147
00:08:01,650 --> 00:08:04,304
Your father was a remarkable commander.

148
00:08:04,305 --> 00:08:06,805
You've worked hard as well, Mr. Garret.

149
00:08:06,806 --> 00:08:10,348
Though lately, you seem troubled
about your fiancee.

150
00:08:10,349 --> 00:08:12,147
Your men are worried about you.

151
00:08:12,551 --> 00:08:14,104
Ari...

152
00:08:14,105 --> 00:08:15,498
Having my men worry about me,

153
00:08:15,499 --> 00:08:17,303
I am an inadequate commander.

154
00:08:17,304 --> 00:08:19,551
I only inherited this post from my father.

155
00:08:19,849 --> 00:08:22,657
The vice commander is far more experienced
and a better judge of character.

156
00:08:22,658 --> 00:08:24,233
He should have been the one to lead...

157
00:08:24,952 --> 00:08:26,206
What am I thinking?

158
00:08:26,207 --> 00:08:29,200
I can't let down the people
who look up to me as a hero.

159
00:08:29,849 --> 00:08:32,158
Excuse me, I'll take a brief rest.

160
00:08:32,159 --> 00:08:34,251
Focus on investigating the monsters first.

161
00:08:34,252 --> 00:08:36,157
If there's any danger,
I'll handle it personally.

162
00:08:36,552 --> 00:08:38,003
Understood.

163
00:08:38,004 --> 00:08:41,005
I'll oversee deploying the men.

164
00:08:41,655 --> 00:08:43,656
Thank you. I leave it to you.

165
00:08:45,201 --> 00:08:47,348
My father, the former commander,

166
00:08:47,349 --> 00:08:48,856
was someone I always admired.

167
00:08:49,353 --> 00:08:50,703
The people called him a hero.

168
00:08:50,704 --> 00:08:53,200
I wanted to become a man like him someday.

169
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:57,151
Garret, hold fast to what I've taught you

170
00:08:57,152 --> 00:08:58,955
and walk the righteous path.

171
00:08:58,956 --> 00:09:00,555
I believed in his words wholeheartedly,

172
00:09:00,556 --> 00:09:02,399
never wanting to let him down,

173
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:04,636
I threw myself into grueling training
day after day.

174
00:09:05,153 --> 00:09:06,104
Yet,

175
00:09:06,105 --> 00:09:10,554
for some reason, Mother often
looked sad when watching me like this.

176
00:09:10,555 --> 00:09:12,658
You've always been so righteous.

177
00:09:12,659 --> 00:09:14,704
I'm proud of you, Garret.

178
00:09:14,705 --> 00:09:15,804
Even so,

179
00:09:15,805 --> 00:09:18,858
when a person is too righteous,

180
00:09:18,859 --> 00:09:21,799
they easily lose sight
of what truly matters.

181
00:09:21,800 --> 00:09:23,300
What truly matters?

182
00:09:23,301 --> 00:09:23,946
Yes.

183
00:09:24,850 --> 00:09:26,446
I'm not sure what you meant,

184
00:09:26,447 --> 00:09:28,601
but I had to go train with Father...

185
00:09:28,602 --> 00:09:30,800
Why not take a break from training

186
00:09:30,801 --> 00:09:32,899
and spend some time with me?

187
00:09:32,900 --> 00:09:34,499
We could take a walk in town.

188
00:09:34,500 --> 00:09:35,503
B-But...

189
00:09:35,504 --> 00:09:37,311
Garret, what are you doing?

190
00:09:38,001 --> 00:09:39,501
Get over here and train.

191
00:09:39,502 --> 00:09:41,858
How do you expect to become a knight
if you waste your time on playing?

192
00:09:42,500 --> 00:09:43,507
Yes, Father!

193
00:09:53,057 --> 00:09:54,052
Years later,

194
00:09:54,053 --> 00:09:56,703
Father was wounded
while protecting his men on a mission.

195
00:09:56,704 --> 00:09:58,456
Though taken to the temple,
he wasn't treated in time,

196
00:09:58,457 --> 00:10:00,105
and he eventually
stepped down as commander.

197
00:10:00,106 --> 00:10:04,355
By then, my parents had grown estranged.

198
00:10:04,356 --> 00:10:07,655
Though never divorced, Mother moved back
to her family and drifted apart from him.

199
00:10:08,802 --> 00:10:09,703
After that,

200
00:10:09,704 --> 00:10:12,800
I succeeded Father in his post.

201
00:10:12,801 --> 00:10:15,407
With wounds like that,
he's probably done for...

202
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:18,055
Guess this is the end of the hero.

203
00:10:18,056 --> 00:10:19,563
Hero...

204
00:10:20,703 --> 00:10:24,052
Did I become a man like my father?

205
00:10:24,053 --> 00:10:27,854
For some reason,
Mother's face flashed in my mind.

206
00:10:27,855 --> 00:10:30,897
I don't want to die like this.

207
00:10:33,093 --> 00:10:35,502
Am I still alive?

208
00:10:36,557 --> 00:10:38,821
Such beautiful blonde hair...

209
00:10:39,500 --> 00:10:40,852
Thank goodness.

210
00:10:40,853 --> 00:10:42,402
You're finally awake.

211
00:10:42,403 --> 00:10:43,651
Who are you?

212
00:10:43,652 --> 00:10:48,155
She stayed by your side all night
tending to your wounds.

213
00:10:48,156 --> 00:10:48,999
I did.

214
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,904
I must try my best to save you,
Mr. Garret.

215
00:10:51,905 --> 00:10:54,108
You saved me...

216
00:10:54,500 --> 00:10:55,660
The moment I opened my eyes,

217
00:10:55,661 --> 00:10:57,908
I thought a goddess
had descended to save me.

218
00:10:59,503 --> 00:11:00,999
I wish to propose to Arianne Trebias

219
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:04,402
of the Trebias family.

220
00:11:05,701 --> 00:11:08,201
She was the one
who pulled me back from death.

221
00:11:09,252 --> 00:11:10,498
I see.

222
00:11:10,499 --> 00:11:13,347
A knight must repay his debt
to his savior with all he has.

223
00:11:13,348 --> 00:11:16,320
Protect her and remain faithful to her
for the rest of your days.

224
00:11:17,100 --> 00:11:18,100
Yes, Father.

225
00:11:18,101 --> 00:11:20,500
Yes, that was my solemn vow to my father.

226
00:11:20,501 --> 00:11:21,601
And yet...

227
00:11:21,602 --> 00:11:23,795
I can't shake the feeling
that long before Arianne saved me,

228
00:11:24,554 --> 00:11:28,509
I had already been making
one wrong choice after another.

